"text": "d'être signalées,"}, {"start": 1145.92, "duration": 0.6, "text": "alors maintenant,"}, {"start": 1146.52, "duration": 0.76, "text": "dans les moins,"}, {"start": 1147.28, "duration": 0.68, "text": "ce que j'aurais aimé,"}, {"start": 1147.96, "duration": 0.4, "text": "en plus,"}, {"start": 1148.96, "duration": 1.24, "text": "c'est une vraie télécommande,"}, {"start": 1150.2, "duration": 2.12, "text": "on a une télécommande au guidon,"}, {"start": 1152.32, "duration": 1.24, "text": "mais ça permet juste"}, {"start": 1153.6, "duration": 2.04, "text": "de switcher un peu"}, {"start": 1155.64, "duration": 1.04, "text": "dans les menus comme ça,"}, {"start": 1156.68, "duration": 0.2, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 1157.04, "duration": 0.56, "text": "c'est bien,"}, {"start": 1157.6, "duration": 1.44, "text": "mais moi,"}, {"start": 1159.04, "duration": 1.12, "text": "ce que j'aimerais éventuellement,"}, {"start": 1160.16, "duration": 0.2, "text": "tu vois,"}, {"start": 1160.36, "duration": 1.6, "text": "c'est une vraie télécommande Bluetooth"}, {"start": 1161.96, "duration": 1.8, "text": "qui te permet de"}, {"start": 1163.76, "duration": 1.04, "text": "vraiment naviguer dedans,"}, {"start": 1165.28, "duration": 1.04, "text": "avancer ta musique,"}, {"start": 1166.48, "duration": 0.56, "text": "reculer,"}, {"start": 1167.04, "duration": 0.48, "text": "monter le son,"}, {"start": 1167.52, "duration": 0.52, "text": "baisser le son,"}, {"start": 1168.04, "duration": 0.24, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1168.28, "duration": 0.2, "text": "tu vois,"}, {"start": 1168.48, "duration": 0.24, "text": "enfin,"}, {"start": 1168.72, "duration": 0.68, "text": "un truc automatique,"}, {"start": 1169.4, "duration": 0.28, "text": "vraiment,"}, {"start": 1171.32, "duration": 0.48, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1172.0, "duration": 0.28, "text": "après,"}, {"start": 1172.28, "duration": 1.0, "text": "ce que j'aurais aimé aussi,"}, {"start": 1173.28, "duration": 0.44, "text": "peut-être,"}, {"start": 1173.72, "duration": 1.52, "text": "c'est un écran avec une meilleure,"}, {"start": 1175.24, "duration": 1.2, "text": "une plus grosse résolution,"}, {"start": 1176.68, "duration": 0.2, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 1176.88, "duration": 0.56, "text": "alors,"}, {"start": 1177.8, "duration": 0.88, "text": "ça fait largement de taf,"}, {"start": 1178.68, "duration": 0.6, "text": "il n'y a aucun problème,"}, {"start": 1179.96, "duration": 0.6, "text": "mais voilà,"}, {"start": 1180.56, "duration": 0.48, "text": "des fois,"}, {"start": 1181.16, "duration": 2.4, "text": "on se dit que l'écran"}, {"start": 1183.56, "duration": 1.36, "text": "est joli malgré tout,"}, {"start": 1184.92, "duration": 1.88, "text": "mais qu'on aimerait peut-être avoir un"}, {"start": 1186.8, "duration": 2.0, "text": "peu plus de résolution,"}, {"start": 1190.04, "duration": 0.72, "text": "je crois que j'ai fait le"}, {"start": 1190.76, "duration": 2.8, "text": "tour à peu près des spécificités,"}, {"start": 1193.56, "duration": 1.72, "text": "une dernière chose,"}, {"start": 1195.48, "duration": 0.2, "text": "si,"}, {"start": 1195.68, "duration": 0.48, "text": "le prix,"}, {"start": 1196.16, "duration": 0.28, "text": "bien sûr,"}, {"start": 1196.44, "duration": 0.88, "text": "c'est super important,"}, {"start": 1197.92, "duration": 0.16, "text": "alors,"}, {"start": 1198.08, "duration": 1.12, "text": "ce n'est pas monstre cher,"}, {"start": 1199.2, "duration": 0.84, "text": "ce n'est pas donné non plus,"}, {"start": 1200.04, "duration": 0.32, "text": "mais enfin,"}, {"start": 1200.36, "duration": 1.68, "text": "pour tous les services que ça amène,"}, {"start": 1202.36, "duration": 2.68, "text": "c'est environ 260 euros avec les capteurs"}, {"start": 1205.04, "duration": 0.8, "text": "de pression de pneus,"}, {"start": 1206.36, "duration": 1.84, "text": "je dis bien environ 260 euros,"}, {"start": 1208.2, "duration": 0.48, "text": "parce que,"}, {"start": 1208.92, "duration": 1.32, "text": "c'est basé sur le dollar,"}, {"start": 1210.24, "duration": 0.2, "text": "alors,"}, {"start": 1210.44, "duration": 0.64, "text": "ça fluctue,"}, {"start": 1211.08, "duration": 0.2, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 1211.28, "duration": 0.44, "text": "tu vois bien,"}, {"start": 1212.8, "duration": 0.68, "text": "aussi bien,"}, {"start": 1213.48, "duration": 1.28, "text": "c'est 260 maintenant,"}, {"start": 1214.76, "duration": 0.52, "text": "et puis demain,"}, {"start": 1215.28, "duration": 1.56, "text": "c'est 240 ou 270,"}, {"start": 1216.84, "duration": 1.32, "text": "après-demain,"}, {"start": 1218.16, "duration": 0.32, "text": "tu as compris,"}, {"start": 1220.48, "duration": 0.2, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1220.68, "duration": 0.28, "text": "ben moi,"}, {"start": 1220.96, "duration": 1.08, "text": "je vais faire plein de la titine,"}, {"start": 1222.04, "duration": 0.2, "text": "là,"}, {"start": 1222.24, "duration": 0.08, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1222.32, "duration": 0.72, "text": "elle va être contente,"}, {"start": 1224.72, "duration": 0.32, "text": "et puis,"}, {"start": 1225.56, "duration": 4.24, "text": "et puis,"}, {"start": 1229.8, "duration": 0.76, "text": "comme d'habitude,"}, {"start": 1230.56, "duration": 0.88, "text": "si vous avez des questions,"}, {"start": 1231.44, "duration": 0.6, "text": "n'hésitez pas,"}, {"start": 1233.36, "duration": 3.76, "text": "la marque Carpuride,"}, {"start": 1237.12, "duration": 0.2, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 1237.68, "duration": 1.16, "text": "c'est le leader mondial,"}, {"start": 1238.84, "duration": 0.36, "text": "je crois,"}, {"start": 1239.2, "duration": 1.0, "text": "de ce type d'appareil,"}, {"start": 1241.04, "duration": 0.24, "text": "ça fait,"}, {"start": 1241.28, "duration": 1.08, "text": "le moment que je travaille avec eux,"}, {"start": 1242.36, "duration": 0.8, "text": "ça fait trois ans maintenant,"}, {"start": 1243.28, "duration": 0.44, "text": "certainement,"}, {"start": 1244.6, "duration": 0.48, "text": "trois ans et demi,"}, {"start": 1245.08, "duration": 0.44, "text": "on va dire,"}, {"start": 1245.52, "duration": 0.2, "text": "allez,"}, {"start": 1245.72, "duration": 1.36, "text": "que je suis avec eux,"}, {"start": 1247.08, "duration": 0.16, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 1247.68, "duration": 1.6, "text": "il n'y a aucun problème sur les SAV,"}, {"start": 1249.28, "duration": 1.12, "text": "il n'y a aucun problème de réponse,"}, {"start": 1250.4, "duration": 0.88, "text": "si jamais il y a un problème,"}, {"start": 1251.28, "duration": 0.44, "text": "une question,"}, {"start": 1251.72, "duration": 0.2, "text": "etc.,"}, {"start": 1252.6, "duration": 0.68, "text": "ils sont vraiment,"}, {"start": 1254.04, "duration": 0.52, "text": "vraiment,"}, {"start": 1255.32, "duration": 1.04, "text": "ils accompagnent le client,"}, {"start": 1256.36, "duration": 0.08, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1256.44, "duration": 0.64, "text": "ils ne sont pas là juste"}, {"start": 1257.08, "duration": 0.76, "text": "pour faire de la vente,"}, {"start": 1258.68, "duration": 0.48, "text": "notamment,"}, {"start": 1259.4, "duration": 0.44, "text": "par exemple,"}, {"start": 1259.84, "duration": 1.32, "text": "j'avais fait gagner à"}, {"start": 1261.16, "duration": 0.84, "text": "un abonné de la chaîne,"}, {"start": 1262.0, "duration": 0.96, "text": "un appareil avec les"}, {"start": 1262.96, "duration": 0.96, "text": "détecteurs d'angle mort,"}, {"start": 1265.2, "duration": 1.2, "text": "je n'avais pas fait gaffe,"}, {"start": 1266.4, "duration": 1.16, "text": "la platine de déconnexion,"}, {"start": 1267.56, "duration": 1.16, "text": "j'avais dû l'abîmer moi-même,"}, {"start": 1268.72, "duration": 0.52, "text": "je ne sais pas,"}, {"start": 1269.56, "duration": 0.8, "text": "et quand je lui envoyais,"}, {"start": 1270.36, "duration": 0.92, "text": "il n'a pas pu le connecter,"}, {"start": 1271.28, "duration": 0.52, "text": "parce qu'il y avait"}, {"start": 1271.8, "duration": 1.4, "text": "un petit picot d'abîmé,"}, {"start": 1273.2, "duration": 0.2, "text": "bon,"}, {"start": 1273.68, "duration": 1.88, "text": "j'ai fait un mail à Carpuride,"}, {"start": 1275.56, "duration": 1.64, "text": "ils ont envoyé directement à l'abonné,"}, {"start": 1277.68, "duration": 1.0, "text": "la platine de connexion,"}, {"start": 1278.68, "duration": 0.12, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 1278.8, "duration": 0.24, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1279.04, "duration": 0.8, "text": "je pense que c'est des gens,"}, {"start": 1280.04, "duration": 0.24, "text": "enfin,"}, {"start": 1280.28, "duration": 0.4, "text": "je pense,"}, {"start": 1280.68, "duration": 0.48, "text": "j'en suis sûr,"}, {"start": 1281.16, "duration": 1.0, "text": "c'est des gens qui sont fiables,"}, {"start": 1282.16, "duration": 1.0, "text": "il n'y a aucun problème avec eux,"}, {"start": 1283.68, "duration": 1.64, "text": "c'est une marque solide,"}, {"start": 1285.32, "duration": 0.24, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1286.84, "duration": 0.48, "text": "eh bien,"}, {"start": 1287.48, "duration": 0.56, "text": "j'ai fini,"}, {"start": 1288.04, "duration": 1.0, "text": "cette vidéo était un peu longue,"}, {"start": 1289.04, "duration": 0.44, "text": "mais il y avait"}, {"start": 1289.48, "duration": 0.84, "text": "beaucoup de choses à dire,"}, {"start": 1290.52, "duration": 0.2, "text": "voilà,"}, {"start": 1290.72, "duration": 0.48, "text": "je suis désolé,"}, {"start": 1292.16, "duration": 0.52, "text": "allez,"}, {"start": 1292.68, "duration": 0.52, "text": "en tous les cas,"}, {"start": 1293.2, "duration": 1.16, "text": "on se retrouve sur la route,"}, {"start": 1294.68, "duration": 1.64, "text": "pour les Alpes Suisses,"}, {"start": 1296.32, "duration": 1.12, "text": "les Dolomites et compagnie,"}, {"start": 1297.44, "duration": 0.24, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 1297.68, "duration": 0.48, "text": "ça va être,"}, {"start": 1298.16, "duration": 1.32, "text": "j'espère qu'elle va être géniale,"}, {"start": 1299.92, "duration": 1.16, "text": "et surtout au niveau météo,"}, {"start": 1301.08, "duration": 1.4, "text": "je voudrais juste pas de canicule,"}, {"start": 1302.48, "duration": 0.68, "text": "et pas de flotte,"}, {"start": 1303.16, "duration": 0.2, "text": "donc,"}, {"start": 1304.08, "duration": 0.48, "text": "je ne suis pas chiant,"}, {"start": 1304.56, "duration": 0.24, "text": "mais bon,"}, {"start": 1305.88, "duration": 0.2, "text": "allez,"}, {"start": 1306.08, "duration": 0.36, "text": "à bientôt,"}, {"start": 1306.44, "duration": 0.2, "text": "à bientôt."}, {"start": 1306.68, "duration": 1.28, "text": "Sous-titrage ST' 501"}]}